{"message":"The reserve for product warranties was $10 million at Dec. 31, 2006 and $4 million at Dec. 31, 2005, both stated in millions. The change from 2005 to 2006 is the 2006 balance minus the 2005 balance.","tool":"calculate","arguments":{"expression":"a - b","variables":{"a":{"value":10,"source":"source:q11n3","unit":"USD_million"},"b":{"value":4,"source":"source:q11n4","unit":"USD_million"}},"sources":{"a":"source:q11n3","b":"source:q11n4"}}}